cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Exact Ray Trajectories in Anisotropic Media: Numerical Experiments"
type: software
abstract: >-
  NumPy experiments for exact ray trajectories in axially varying non-diagonal
  optical metrics, including independent geodesic integration, closed forms,
  endpoint inverses, Maxwell checks, and reproducible figure data. Version 1.3.0
  includes comparisons for five closed-form solutions at three parameter values
  each, paired ordinary and extraordinary rays, and five extraordinary
  trajectories after assumed mode conversion, with complete transverse
  projections and independent numerical comparisons. Conversion events and
  amplitudes are not predicted. The figure sources and PDFs are included.
authors:
